 "fn-41": "<a href=\"https://kotobank.jp/word/井戸屋形-435033\"><code>kotobank-idoyakata</code></a> - デジタル大辞泉「A simple structure consisting of nothing more than posts set up beside the well with a roof provided on top of them.」 (Digital Daijisen) (translated from the Japanese by this project; original: 「井戸のそばに柱を立てて、その上に屋根を設けただけの簡単な建物。」) 精選版日本国語大辞典「A simple structure consisting of nothing more than posts set up at the side of the well with a roof provided on top of them.」 (Seisenban Nihon Kokugo Daijiten) (translated from the Japanese by this project; original: 「井戸の脇に柱を立て、その上に屋根を設けただけの簡単な建物。」)",
