 "fn-43": "<a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%AC%E7%94%BA%E5%AE%B6\"><code>kyomachiya-jawiki</code></a> - 「Because the plot on which a machiya stands is narrow at the frontage and deep in extent, it is called an \"eel's bed\".」 (translated from the Japanese by this project; original: 「町家の立地する敷地は、間口が狭く奥行きが深いため、「うなぎの寝床」と呼ばれる。」)「And its characteristics were summed up as \"eel's bed / eel dwelling\", \"work and residence in one\", and the like.」 (translated from the Japanese by this project; original: 「そしてその特徴を「鰻の寝床・鰻ずまい」「職住一致」などとした」) (the machiya lot, narrow at the front and deep, is called the \"eel's bed\"; its character was summed up as \"eel's bed / eel dwelling\" and \"work and residence united\".)",
