 "fn-113": "<a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%93%A6%E8%91%BA%E3%81%8D\"><code>kawarabuki-jawiki</code></a> - 「Because the tiles can each be removed easily, even when one breaks it can be replaced and repair is easy, but」 (translated from the Japanese by this project; original: 「瓦一つ一つが容易に取り外しが可能なため、1枚が割れても取替えが可能で修理がしやすいが」)",
 "fn-114": "no publicly readable source (searched 2026-09-14: the FAO charcoal-making chapters cited beside this sentence rank fines and high-volatile charcoal as the most prone to spontaneous combustion and give no ignition temperature; the maritime bulk-cargo code's charcoal schedule is where a self-heating test temperature would be stated)",
